@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT domain

-- ind-a-tests-fixtures.l4: shared fixtures for ind-a's independent tests (no assertions of its own beyond a
-- smoke check).  Values here are facts of the scenarios in work/ind-a/expectations.md, not expectations.

§ `ind-a shared fixtures`

`ind-a person` MEANS
    Person WITH
        `reference for the person` IS "ind-a-person-1"
        `kind of person` IS `an individual`

`ind-a other person` MEANS
    Person WITH
        `reference for the person` IS "ind-a-person-2"
        `kind of person` IS `an individual`

-- The commencement day of the Law under s.63(a)(1): the later of 2025-04-14 (three months from publication on
-- 2025-01-14) and 2025-07-16 (the Fees Regulations in force seven days from publication on 2025-07-09).
`ind-a commencement day` MEANS YMD 2025 7 16

`ind-a no rest days` MEANS
    `Calendar of rest days` WITH `days of rest, recess or holiday` IS EMPTY

-- An illustrative calendar (not Israel's): the Saturdays that the scenarios touch.
`ind-a Saturdays` MEANS
    `Calendar of rest days` WITH
        `days of rest, recess or holiday` IS LIST YMD 2026 1 3, YMD 2026 1 10, YMD 2026 1 17, YMD 2026 1 24, YMD 2026 1 31, YMD 2026 2 7, YMD 2026 4 4, YMD 2026 4 11, YMD 2029 3 31, YMD 2031 2 1

GIVEN convicted IS A BOOLEAN
      charged IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Record of offences`
`ind-a record` convicted charged MEANS
    `Record of offences` WITH
        `convicted of a criminal offence` IS convicted
        `convicted of a disciplinary offence` IS FALSE
        `charged with a criminal offence and no final judgment yet` IS charged
        `a disciplinary complaint is pending with no final judgment` IS FALSE

GIVEN granted IS A DATE
      kind IS A `Licence kind`
      temporary IS A BOOLEAN
      renewals IS A LIST OF DATE
      recorded IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A Licence
`ind-a licence` granted kind temporary renewals recorded MEANS
    Licence WITH
        `the holder` IS `ind-a person`
        `the kind of licence` IS kind
        `a temporary licence under section 9` IS temporary
        `granted on` IS granted
        `renewed on` IS renewals
        `validity ends on, as recorded` IS recorded
        `revoked on` IS NOTHING
        `suspended from` IS NOTHING
        `suspended until` IS NOTHING

-- An ordinary licence granted on a day, never renewed, no end recorded (the Law computes it).
GIVEN granted IS A DATE
      kind IS A `Licence kind`
GIVETH A Licence
`ind-a plain licence` granted kind MEANS
    `ind-a licence` granted kind FALSE EMPTY NOTHING

GIVEN first IS A DATE
      last IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Period of work on cooling systems`
`ind-a worked` first last MEANS
    `Period of work on cooling systems` WITH
        `first day of the period` IS first
        `last day of the period` IS last

-- An applicant: every field positional, in this order.
GIVEN adult IS A BOOLEAN
      citizen IS A BOOLEAN
      resident IS A BOOLEAN
      record IS A `Record of offences`
      licences IS A LIST OF Licence
      certificates IS A LIST OF Certificate
      technician IS A BOOLEAN
      `practical engineer` IS A BOOLEAN
      programme IS A BOOLEAN
      engineer IS A BOOLEAN
      periods IS A LIST OF `Period of work on cooling systems`
      electrician IS A BOOLEAN
      height IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN Applicant
`ind-a applicant in full` adult citizen resident record licences certificates technician `practical engineer` programme engineer periods electrician height MEANS
    Applicant WITH
        `the person` IS `ind-a person`
        `of full age` IS adult
        `an Israeli citizen` IS citizen
        `an Israeli resident` IS resident
        `record of offences` IS record
        `licences held` IS licences
        `certificates held` IS certificates
        `registered as a certified technician in refrigeration and air conditioning` IS technician
        `registered as a certified practical engineer in refrigeration and air conditioning` IS `practical engineer`
        `completed a study programme that includes the complement course` IS programme
        `registered as an engineer in the mechanical branch` IS engineer
        `periods of work on cooling systems` IS periods
        `holds a valid electrician licence of a kind listed in the Electricity Regulations` IS electrician
        `holds a valid working-at-height approval` IS height

-- An adult Israeli citizen and resident with a clean record, holding the given certificates and nothing else.
GIVEN certificates IS A LIST OF Certificate
GIVETH AN Applicant
`ind-a applicant holding` certificates MEANS
    `ind-a applicant in full` TRUE TRUE TRUE (`ind-a record` FALSE FALSE) EMPTY certificates FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EMPTY FALSE FALSE

GIVEN applicant IS AN Applicant
      kind IS A `Licence kind`
      day IS A DATE
GIVETH AN Application
`ind-a application` applicant kind day MEANS
    Application WITH
        `the applicant` IS applicant
        `the kind of licence sought` IS kind
        `an application to renew` IS FALSE
        `an application for a temporary licence` IS FALSE
        `the day of the application` IS day

#ASSERT `ind-a commencement day` EQUALS YMD 2025 7 16
